sh persists, determined to join forces with Noor in their quest for truth.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/htt9O4qrZEVqp6oae2rMV7PM6Ug.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9QaWxsLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDI0LS0lMjkv.1.4","title":"The Drug Test","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-07-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Forever Cure Pharma's CEO, Bramha Gill, stunned by outcry over trial deaths, seeks CM's help. Dr. Prakash orders Gurgaon plant re-inspection; no evidence found. An insider who discovers the truth is being forced to shut down.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8fcs0oyYNoAyktRwK6WHCITj9gY.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9QaWxsLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDI0LS0lMjkv.1.5","title":"The Bribe","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-07-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Amidst damaging articles, Bramha Gill rushes to the US for FMA approval of their cancer drug. Dr. Prakash faces a setback when he finds his mentor has joined hands with the enemy. Determined, Prakash opts to meet MCGI's Mr. Raman.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pHrgDpOAX08pv3OaNA482V0ngln.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9QaWxsLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDI0LS0lMjkv.1.6","title":"The Despair","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-07-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Denied by superiors, Prakash takes Forever Cure Pharma to court for plant inspection. Court orders an inspection only to uncover the rot in the practices of Forever cure pharma.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yyMx5wquRtCnx8ihK3Fzsm7fMrN.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9QaWxsLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDI0LS0lMjkv.1.7","title":"The Conspiracy","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-07-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dr. Prakash decides to test drugs by his own means but faces a setback. Yet he approaches the supreme court